= Conclusion
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Phase 2 delivers two scientific contributions:

#card(title: "Scientific outputs", color: accent2)[
  #set text(size: 10pt)
  #bullet[*Empirical Exponential Wall:* Reproducible evidence that CBC becomes intractable at $n approx 15$ for BT-structured MinLA instances. This is a BT-specific data point in the MinLA benchmark literature.]
  #bullet[*Motivation for the heuristic:* The data formally justifies Phase 3's Simulated Annealing approach — not as an engineering convenience, but as a *necessity* for real-world BT sizes.]
  #bullet[*Ground-truth boundary:* Instances with $n <= 12$ can be solved exactly; these form the validation set for the Phase 4 Optimality Gap analysis.]
]

